sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Frontend UI
    participant ChatAPI as Chat API
    participant MainAgent as Main AI Agent
    participant DiagramAgent as Diagram Specialist Agent
    participant AssetMgmt as Asset Management API
    participant DB as Database
    
    User->>UI: Request via chat interface
    UI->>ChatAPI: POST /api/conversations/{id}/messages
    ChatAPI->>MainAgent: Process user request
    MainAgent->>DB: Retrieve project context
    DB-->>MainAgent: Return project data
    
    alt Diagram creation/update needed
        MainAgent->>DiagramAgent: Delegate diagram task
        DiagramAgent->>DiagramAgent: Generate/modify diagram
        DiagramAgent-->>MainAgent: Return Mermaid diagram code
        MainAgent->>AssetMgmt: Store diagram as asset
        AssetMgmt->>DB: Save to database
        DB-->>AssetMgmt: Confirm storage
        AssetMgmt-->>MainAgent: Confirm asset creation
    end
    
    MainAgent-->>ChatAPI: Return response with asset references
    ChatAPI-->>UI: Return updated conversation
    UI->>AssetMgmt: GET /api/projects/{id}/assets
    AssetMgmt->>DB: Retrieve latest assets
    DB-->>AssetMgmt: Return asset data
    AssetMgmt-->>UI: Return updated assets
    UI-->>User: Display response and updated diagrams
